  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180\u000042C (350\u000042F).",
    "Mix the sliced chillies, chopped basil, and chopped parsley in a bowl.",
    "In a separate pan, melt the butter over medium heat and add the minced garlic. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Combine the leavening powder with the gluten-free flour (if using).",
    "Add the sliced onion to the pan with the garlic and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Mix the cooked onion and garlic with the chilli and herb mixture.",
    "Pour the olive oil into the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and top with crushed tortilla chips.",
    "Drizzle with a little extra olive oil and sprinkle with salt and sugar to taste.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes or until the top is golden and crispy."
  ],
